B.Ki=new A.jh("comp_synergy","Synergy Marine Group","Cadet Rahul Nair","Deck Cadet","2025 Intake","The Synergy technical panel focused 70% on COLREGs Rule 14 & 15 scenario diagrams and 30% on OWS 15 PPM solenoid valve logic. They asked me to draw a crossing situation on paper and state give-way obligations clearly.",B.Ra)
